<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><th align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Name&nbsp;&nbsp;</th><th align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Modeled Demand&nbsp;&nbsp;</th><th align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;% of Sakrální památky Demand&nbsp;&nbsp;</th></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Oblastní muzeum + Kostel sv.Kateřiny v Chomutově&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;44&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;33.85%&nbsp;&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Kostel Nanebevzetí Panny Marie&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;41&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;31.54%&nbsp;&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Františkánský klášter v Kadani&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;28&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;21.54%&nbsp;&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Klášter Osek&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;17&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;13.08%&nbsp;&nbsp;</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Přírodní zajímavosti (Natural Features) — 159 Visitors (0.05% of Total Demand)</summary>\n\n<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><th align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Name&nbsp;&nbsp;</th><th align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Modeled Demand&nbsp;&nbsp;</th><th align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;% of Přírodní zajímavosti Demand&nbsp;&nbsp;</th></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Soutěsky Kamenice&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;110&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;69.18%&nbsp;&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Jezero Milada&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;49&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;30.82%&nbsp;&nbsp;</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Parky a rozhledny (Parks & Viewpoints) — 33 Visitors (0.01% of Total Demand)</summary>\n\n<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><th align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Name&nbsp;&nbsp;</th><th align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Modeled Demand&nbsp;&nbsp;</th><th align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;% of Parky a rozhledny Demand&nbsp;&nbsp;</th></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Radniční věž Žatec&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;23&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;69.70%&nbsp;&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Městké sklepy a věž&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;10&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;30.30%&nbsp;&nbsp;</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Zábavní parky a aquaparky (Theme Parks & Aquaparks) — 50 Visitors (0.02% of Total Demand)</summary>\n\n<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><th align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Name&nbsp;&nbsp;</th><th align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Modeled Demand&nbsp;&nbsp;</th><th align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;% of Zábavní parky a aquaparky Demand&nbsp;&nbsp;</th></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Chrám chmele a piva a Galerie Sladovna Žatec&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;50&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;100.00%&nbsp;&nbsp;</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n</details>\n\n### Sport\n\n<details>\n<summary>Stadiony a arény (Stadiums) — 793 Spectators (0.27% of Total Demand)</summary>\n\n<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><th align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Name&nbsp;&nbsp;</th><th align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Modeled Demand&nbsp;&nbsp;</th><th align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;% of Stadiony a arény Demand&nbsp;&nbsp;</th></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Zimní stadion Ivana Hlinky — HC Verva Litvínov&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;437&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;55.11%&nbsp;&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Na Stínadlech — FK Teplice&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;156&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;19.67%&nbsp;&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Rocknet Aréna — Piráti Chomutov&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;152&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;19.17%&nbsp;&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Zimní stadion Ústí nad Labem — HC Slovan Ústí nad Labem&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;48&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align=\"right\">&nbsp;&nbsp;6.05%&nbsp;&nbsp;</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n</details>\n\n## Additional Features\n\n- **Building Collision** — A buildings index is included for all non-filtered buildings, assigning each a flat foundation depth of **−10 m** in-game. This provides underground collision geometry so that tunnels interact correctly with building footprints.\n\n- **Neighborhood Labels** — Three layers of place name labels are embedded in the map:\n  - _City labels_ — Major city names at the metropolitan scale.\n  - _Municipality labels_ — Names of all obce within the map boundary.\n  - _Neighborhood labels_ — Basic settlement unit names (ZSJ — _základní sídelní jednotka_) from RUIAN cadastral data.\n\n## Methodology\n\nThis map is generated through a six-phase pipeline that transforms Czech government census and employment statistics into georeferenced origin/destination demand points.\n\n**Point Seeding:** Candidate points are placed within each _obec_ (municipality) using population-weighted centroids derived from GHS-POP 100 m population grid data (JRC Global Human Settlement Layer R2023A).\n\n**Mesh Reconciliation:** Initial point populations are refined by solving a constrained convex optimization that approximates each point's mass to residential and economic mesh ideals while preserving CZSO 2021 Census (Sčítání lidu, domů a bytů 2021) totals for each obec.\n\n**Aggregation:** A global scaling factor reconciles the mismatch between boundary-captured employed residents (from Sčítání 2021) and workplace employees (from CZSO employment statistics).\n\n**Commute Assignment:** Commute flows are assigned directly from _DojizdkovyProud_ — the official 2021 Census O/D commuter flow table at _ZSJ-díl_ (sub-municipal) granularity.\n\n**Special Demand Injection:** Non-commuter demand generators — airports, universities, major sports facilities, libraries, and tourism attractions — are injected as an additive layer. Airport demand from Czech CAA (ÚCL) statistics; university demand from MŠMT DSIA F21 faculty enrollment; attraction demand from tourdata.cz visitor counts across all 14 Czech _kraje_ (~1,800 attractions). Sports arena demand derived from per-club average attendance × home matches; library demand from per-library visitor counts in operator annual reports and NIPOS aggregates.\n\n**Layout Reconciliation:** A final spatial pass resolves point overlaps and ensures map clickability while keeping special-demand locations fixed.\n\n## Data Sources\n\nAll demand modeling is derived from freely available Czech government statistical datasets and public geospatial resources.\n\n### Census & Demographics\n\n- **2021 Census** (Sčítání lidu, domů a bytů 2021 / SLDB 2021) — [ČSÚ / CZSO](https://www.czso.cz/)\n- **Commute O/D at ZSJ-díl level** (DojizdkovyProud) — [ČSÚ / CZSO](https://www.czso.cz/)\n- **Workplace Employment Statistics** (Počet obsazených pracovních míst) — [ČSÚ Geodata](https://geodata.statistika.cz/)\n\n### Geospatial Reference\n\n- **100 m Population Grid** (GHS-POP R2023A) — [JRC / EU Copernicus](https://ghsl.jrc.ec.europa.eu/)\n- **Administrative Boundaries** (RUIAN _obec_ + ZSJ-díl polygons) — [ČÚZK](https://www.cuzk.cz/)\n- **Building Polygons & Use Classification** (RUIAN buildings + ZpůsobVyužití codes; floor counts) — [ČÚZK](https://www.cuzk.cz/)\n- **ML Building Heights** (GlobalBuildingAtlas / GBA LoD1 — height enrichment for buildings without RUIAN floor counts) — [TUM Zhu-XLab on Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/datasets/zhu-xlab/GBA.LoD1)\n- **Overture Maps Foundation** (auxiliary building footprint side-channel for the RUIAN height cascade) — [Overture](https://overturemaps.org/)\n\n### Special Demand Statistics\n\n- **Faculty Enrollment Data** (MŠMT DSIA F21) — [MŠMT](https://dsia.msmt.cz/)\n- **Airport Passenger Statistics** — [ÚCL / Czech CAA](https://www.caa.cz/statistiky)\n- **Tourism Visitor Statistics** — [tourdata.cz / CzechTourism](https://tourdata.cz/)\n- **Library Visitor Statistics** — [NIPOS Statistika kultury](https://www.statistikakultury.cz/) + per-library annual reports\n- **Football League Attendance** (Chance Liga + Chance národní liga) — [chanceliga.cz](https://www.chanceliga.cz/statistiky-rekordy)\n- **Ice Hockey League Attendance** (Tipsport Extraliga + Chance Liga) — [hokej.cz](https://www.hokej.cz/)\n\n## License\n\nThis map data is released under the [GNU General Public License v3.0](https://github.com/ahkimn/subwaybuilder-eu-maps/blob/main/LICENSE).\n\n## Credits\n\nMap authored by [Yukina-](https://subwaybuildermodded.com/credits/)",
